  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.5.18 (00000093)\n\t\t\t- CBHI.Models.Auth to 3.5.18; SSContext maps Projects, ProjectMembers, ProjectTasks, ProjectNotes\n\t\t\t- ProjectRepo (IProjectRepo): project board load/save/move/archive, sub-tasks, progress notes, SSO people list\n\t\t\tVersion 3.5.16\n\t\t\t- CBHI.Models.Auth to 3.5.16; HelpFiles.ShortDescription mapped (saved and read with the help file)\n\t\t\tVersion 3.5.15\n\t\t\t- CBHI.Models.Auth to 3.5.14 (HelpFile.Keywords)\n\t\t\t- HelpRepo: SearchHelpFiles(searchText, appName) word search\n\t\t\t- HelpRepo: AddView(helpId) increments NumberOfViews\n\t\t\tVersion 3.5.14\n\t\t\t- HelpRepo: help media folder is configurable (new HelpRepo(options, helpMediaPath))\n\t\t\t- HelpRepo: GuidFileName stores the file name only; old full-path rows still resolve\n\t\t\tVersion 3.5.13\n\t\t\t- serialize AppUsers/UserGroups on UserInfo\n\t\t\tVersion 3.5.12\n\t\t\t- This should also be republished if any consumer uses the auth\n\t\t\t- business-layer package and needs the updated behavior.\n\t\t\tVersion 3.5.11\n\t\t\t- Updated dependencies\n\t\t\t- Add SaveUserParameter class for API SaveUser Post\n\t\t\tVersion 3.5.10\n\t\t\t- Update packages to keep current\n\t\t\tVersion 3.5.6\n\t\t\t- CBHI.Models.Shared to 3.5.6\n\t\t\tVersion 3.5.5\n\t\t\t- JwtService Added method to generate JWT token for user authentication.\n\t\t\t- SSContextProcedures added GetAllUserInfos\n\t\t\tVersion 3.5.3\n\t\t\t- Updated dependencies\"\n\t\t\t- DevExpress, EntityFrameworkCore\n\n\t\t\tVersion 3.5.2\n\t\t\t- Changed all nullable fields to \"string?\"\n\n\t\t\tVersion 3.5.1\n\t\t\t- Repacked due to Package deployment issues\n\n\t\t\tVersion 3.0.0\n\t\t\t- Upgraded to .NET 9.0\n\n\t\t\tVersion 2.0.3\n\t\t\t- Updated dependencies",
